-The persisted app language setting is `"system" | "ar" | "en" | "es" | "fr" | "ja" | "ko" | "pt-BR" | "ru" | "zh-CN"`. `"system"` follows the device or browser locale when it maps to a supported locale; unsupported system locales fall back to English. Japanese maps from system locales `ja` and Japanese regional locales. Korean maps from system locales `ko` and Korean regional locales. Brazilian Portuguese maps from system locales `pt-BR` and bare `pt`; other Portuguese regional locales remain unsupported until explicitly added.
+The persisted app language setting is `"system" | "ar" | "de" | "en" | "es" | "fr" | "ja" | "ko" | "pt-BR" | "ru" | "zh-CN"`. `"system"` follows the device or browser locale when it maps to a supported locale; unsupported system locales fall back to English. German maps from system locales `de` and German regional locales such as `de-DE`, `de-AT`, and `de-CH`. Japanese maps from system locales `ja` and Japanese regional locales. Korean maps from system locales `ko` and Korean regional locales. Brazilian Portuguese maps from system locales `pt-BR` and bare `pt`; other Portuguese regional locales remain unsupported until explicitly added.
 
